{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2022-08-09 09:30:00', 'title': 'J.P. MORGAN ASSET MANAGEMENT LAUNCHES JPMORGAN ACTIVE GROWTH ETF (JGRO)', 'text': 'UNIFIES TWO INDUSTRY-LEADING GROWTH STRATEGIES INTO ONE ACTIVELY MANAGED ETF NEW YORK , AUG. 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0J.P. MORGAN ASSET MANAGEMENT (JPMAM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF JPMORGAN ACTIVE GROWTH ETF (JGRO), AN ACTIVELY MANAGED STYLE PURE GROWTH ETF THAT SEEKS TO OUTPERFORM THE RUSSELL 1000 GROWTH INDEX.'}